invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_ifma.c
catches: rsa_ifma_model_test
reason: normalize_digits adds each register's eight carry bits without the
  carry out of the register below, so a run of lanes at 2^52 - 1 that
  crosses a register's edge passes no carry into the register above.
  bin/rsa_ifma_model_test's run of normalize_digits on lanes at
  2^52 - 1 sees the number change.

--- old
        unsigned total = shifted + propagate + carry_from_below;
--- new
        unsigned total = shifted + propagate + (carry_from_below & 0);
